     "titulo": "Saying what you like",
     "texto": [
      "You say **Saya suka + noun** or **Saya suka + activity**. As in English \"I like\", the subject of **suka** is the person who likes."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Intensity",
     "texto": [
      "**Saya sangat suka menari** and **Saya suka sekali menari** both mean \"I really like dancing\". Here **sekali** intensifies; in other contexts it can mean \"once\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
